<title>NETHERLANDS: VREDESTEIN 1996 NET PROFIT 14.1 MLN NLG.</title>
<headline>VREDESTEIN 1996 NET PROFIT 14.1 MLN NLG.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996 to Dec 31</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.84 vs   1.71</p>
<p>    Net profit			     14.1 vs  12.6 </p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  0.85 vs  0.85</p>
<p>    Turnover				504.8 vs  500.5</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Vredestein NV.</p>
<p>Vredestein said results in the second half of 1997 would be</p>
<p>significantly above those in the first half, due to the usual</p>
<p>seasonal factors.</p>
<p>&quot;Taking into account the economic situation in West Europe</p>
<p>and recovering consumer spending in Germany, as well as</p>
<p>Vredestein's strengthened market position, we expect a slight</p>
<p>improvement in 1997 results,&quot; Vredestein said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
